@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
title 新建项目通信图（协作图，编号表示消息顺序）
object "ui : app.js" as UI
object "api : ApiHandler" as API
object "auth : AuthService" as Auth
object "service : DecorationManagementService" as Service
object "db : DatabaseManager" as DB
UI --> API : 1: POST /api/projects
API --> Auth : 1.1: requireUser()\n1.2: requireWritePermission()
Auth --> DB : 1.1.1: 清理 / 查询会话
API --> Service : 1.3: createProject(payload)
Service --> DB : 1.3.1: 查询客户与员工\n1.3.2: insert(projects)\n1.3.3: 查询项目及关联列表
Service --> API : 1.4: 返回项目 Map
API --> UI : 1.5: 201 JSON
@enduml
